Generated Query:
```sql
SELECT Policy_Number, Effective_Date, Expiration_Date FROM Policy;
```

```sql
SELECT T1.Claim_Number, T2.Claim_Amount FROM Claim AS T1 INNER JOIN Claim_Amount AS T2 ON T1.Claim_Identifier = T2.Claim_Identifier WHERE T2.Amount_Type_Code = 'Expense Reserve';
```

```sql
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Policy_Identifier) AS Number_of_Policies FROM Policy;
```

```sql
SELECT COUNT(Claim_Identifier) AS Total_Claims FROM Claim;
```

```sql
SELECT T1.Company_Claim_Number, T2.Claim_Amount FROM Claim AS T1 INNER JOIN Claim_Amount AS T2 ON T1.Claim_Identifier = T2.Claim_Identifier WHERE T2.Amount_Type_Code = 'Loss Payment';
```
